  "facts": "NoteCube is an app that records voice, transcribes it in real time, and organizes it into a summary, decisions and to-dos. When a host starts a recording at a meeting or event, attendees scan a QR code to see captions with no app install or sign-up, and receive the notes when it ends. It has a feature that turns lectures into vocab lists. Free is 60 minutes in total. Pro is $9.99 per week or $99.99 per year, with 300 minutes per month. There is a screen offering a 3-day free trial on the annual price.",
